linxpad (1.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fixed stale cached icon path returning null pixmap instead of letter-avatar fallback.
  * Fixed SVG icons without Qt SVG plugin causing blank icon slots.
  * Fixed transient .desktop file absence immediately removing app from grid; app now
    survives up to 3 consecutive missed scans before being removed.
  * Fixed drag-and-drop to a full page (exactly page_size items) overflowing sort
    positions into the next page's slot range.
  * Fixed icon size parser misreading retina-style directory names (e.g. 2x-retina)
    as a valid NxN size, causing the wrong icon resolution to be selected.
  * IconResolver now evicts stale cache entries and re-resolves, so a replacement
    theme icon is found after reinstalling a package.
  * Install script: added --global and non-interactive mode flags.

 -- Andrianos Papamarkou <papamarkoua@gmail.com>  Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000

linxpad (1.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New application icon (linxpad.png) and alternative glow icon (linxpad-glow.png).
  * Removed linxpad-folder.png icon — folder icons now show a live preview collage of their contents.
  * AppImage fixes: resolved startup failure on Debian and Ubuntu.
  * Touchpad pinch-to-close gesture support.
  * Added /usr/local/share/applications/ to desktop file detection.
  * Added Ubuntu 26.04 package target.
  * Removed Flatpak packaging support.
  * Minor bug fixes and stability improvements.

 -- Andrianos Papamarkou <papamarkoua@gmail.com>  Wed, 01 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000

linxpad (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Bug fix Debian package release.

